Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I always sat in the back seat growing\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching my older siblings take the\Nwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came the day I sat in the driver's\Nseat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time Dad let me drive, I was\Nso nervous. The car kept stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Checking the mirror over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my phone lights up, day or night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I drive my sisters home at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,By day, I take my parents on their\Nerrands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The little ones sit on my lap and hold\Nthe wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The little kid from the back seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the one who brings everyone home.
